@startuml
title UML - Sealed GL export, lost acknowledgment and audited recovery
actor "Finance adjuster" as staff
participant "Controls" as controls
participant "Finance" as finance
database "Finance store" as fs
participant "Core read port" as core
participant "Worker / Platform" as worker
participant "Synthetic GL" as gl
database "Simulator store" as gs
staff -> controls : propose exact FINANCE_CHART document
actor "Independent approver" as checker
checker -> controls : approve as a different canonical person
staff -> finance : publish exact approved chart
finance -> controls : recheck current grants, kind, digest and expiry
finance -> fs : immutable chart version + durable audit intent
worker -> core : bounded immutable journal page
core --> finance : source batch / operation / legs / account kinds
finance -> fs : seal effective chart, exact mapped legs and totals\nunique source batch + export identity
finance -> worker : stable original export job
worker -> fs : commit attempt, transport lease and fence
worker -> gl : signed original sealed batch
gl -> gs : persist source deduplication + exact receipt
gs --> gl : committed original provider journal reference
gl -x worker : response lost after commit
worker -> fs : OUTCOME_UNKNOWN; retain original request
worker -> gl : signed inquiry of original source and digest
gl -> gs : recover immutable original receipt after restart
gl --> worker : fresh signed envelope / same receipt identity
worker -> fs : under current fence: receipt + BOOKED + audit atomically
note over worker,fs
No database transaction spans HTTP.
GL export has no Core money command.
end note
alt conflicting receipt or bounded retry budget exhausted
 worker -> fs : REVIEW_REQUIRED + immutable packet observation
 finance -> controls : stable owned Finance case
 staff -> finance : recovery(reason, scoped idempotency key)
 finance -> controls : current Finance adjuster + REVIEW queue
 finance -> fs : immutable request, greater generation, eight more attempts
 finance -> worker : stable recovery job (old generations superseded)
 worker -> gl : original sealed batch inquiry
 alt authenticated original NOT_FOUND
  worker -> fs : record signed NOT_FOUND under current fence
  worker -> gl : replay exact original sealed batch
  gl -> gs : strict unique original source / export
 end
 gl --> worker : original authenticated BOOKED receipt
 worker -> fs : receipt + BOOKED; retain case and audit history
end
@enduml
